r must be clear about the status","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the license: don’t display “expired” if the status is “revoked”. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"date and time corresponding to the new status should be displayed (e.g.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“The license expired on 01 January 2018”).","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the license has been revoked, the user message should display the number"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of devices which registered to the server. This count can be calculated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the number of “register” events in the status document. If no event is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"logged in the status document, no such message should appear (certainly not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“The license was registered by 0 devices”)."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Errors while checking the status of the License, using the Status Document.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://Readium/s5ErrorP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/Readium\/s5ErrorP","title":"Swift.Error"},"doc://Readium/documentation/ReadiumLCP/StatusError/returned(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Readium\/documentation\/ReadiumLCP\/StatusError\/returned(_:)","title":"StatusError.returned(_:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/readiumlcp\/statuserror\/returned(_:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This license has been returned on the given date."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"returned"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DateV","text":"Date"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}]},"doc://Readium/documentation/ReadiumLCP/StatusError":{"role":"symbol","navigato